# WhatsApp Chat Analyzer

A Streamlit-based WhatsApp Chat Analysis project.

## Features

- Total Messages
- Word Count
- Most Active Users
- Emoji Analysis
- Monthly Timeline
- Daily Timeline
- Activity Heatmap

## Built With

- Python (Version - 3.12)  
- Pandas
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn
- Streamlit

## Run Locally

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
streamlit run app.py
